 of the 2020 targets of between 15% and 17%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/24/ericsson-eric-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q1","e":"eric","d":"2020-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"…and Managed Services then, lower cost in the quarter and efficiency gains coming out of the investments we do in R&D, therefore, artificial intelligence, etc. So I wanted here to take the opportunity also to highlight some of the planning assumptions that impact the gross margin. And as we…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/ericsson-eric-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q1","e":"eric","d":"2020-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"And here, we're focusing, of course, the investments on 5G, but also AI, for example, across the segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/ericsson-eric-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q1","e":"eric","d":"2020-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"So, in the first quarter here, we recorded 40.4%, again, excluding restructuring, up from 37.1% in Q4, driven by improvements in all segments, but as a matter of fact, also by a higher share of IPR in this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/22/ericsson-eric-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2020-07-17","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"And we intend to continue to invest in R&D, as we have done in AI and automation, to support 5G and efficiency gains in service delivery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q2-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"Operating income improved to 4.5 billion, excluding restructuring, versus 3.9.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q2-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2020-07-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"A couple of items, the restructuring was 700 million in the quarter, and that's the Edge Gravity closure that Borje mentioned, but also related to the acquired antenna business, as we have announced earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/17/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q2-2020-earni.aspx"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2020-10-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"In managed services, the strategy continues to be to invest in automation, analytics, AI to sharpen the offering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q3-2020-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"Gross margin reached 43.2% excluding restructuring, and it's improvements across all business segments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q3-2020-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2020-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"Our operating margin was 15.6% excluding restructuring costs, one of the highest for a long period of time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/21/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q3-2020-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2021-01-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"We continue to invest in R&D in managed services to drive automation and AI that will help our portfolio to grow in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q4-2020-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2021-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"Operating income, 29.1 billion, as you see excluding restructuring, an improvement of 7 billion or 32% over last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q4-2020-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2020 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2021-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"Operating income then 11 billion excluding restructuring, and an operating margin of 15.8%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/29/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q4-2020-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2021 Q1","e":"eric","d":"2021-04-21","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"We also continue to develop the business, growing gross margin, but we're also continuing the investments in automation and AI in order to develop new solutions for our customers, where we see increasing traction that will, over time, change the margin profile of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/21/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q1-2021-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2021 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2021-07-16","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"Also in managed services, we continue to invest in AI solutions for our customers and that will further strengthen our competitiveness.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/16/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q2-2021-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2021 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2021-07-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"So this results in an EBIT of SEK5.8 billion, excluding restructuring up from four and a half a year-ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/16/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q2-2021-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2021 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2021-10-19","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"We also saw that network optimization grew primarily in Europe and we continue to invest in developing our p