naktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q3-2022-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2022 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2022-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"And when I talk about profitability numbers, those will be excluding restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/20/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q3-2022-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2022 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2022-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"And all of these actions are of course to ensure that we secure our ability to deliver on the long-term financial targets for the Group, which is, as you know, 15% to 18% EBITA excluding restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/10/20/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-eric-q3-2022-earni/"},{"c":"ERIC 2022 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2023-01-20","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"If you are on the streaming, please mute the webcast audio while asking the question to minimize any sort of audio feedback and disturbance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/01/20/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2022/"},{"c":"ERIC 2022 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2023-01-20","l":"streaming","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"Before starting, I just want to say that we have some issues with the streaming of this conference call, so we are focusing on the audio right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/01/20/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2022/"},{"c":"ERIC 2022 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2023-01-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"Target achievement is supported by cost savings, growth in our IPR revenues, portfolio changes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/01/20/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2022/"},{"c":"ERIC 2022 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2023-01-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"Most notably, we're taking cost savings initiatives that we expect to take full effect by the end of 2023 and with the impact starting to show during Q2 of 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/01/20/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2022/"},{"c":"ERIC 2023 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2023-07-14","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"If you're streaming the webcast, please mute the webcast audio while asking question to minimize any kind of audio feedback.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/14/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q2-2023/"},{"c":"ERIC 2023 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2023-07-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"The EBITA margin, excluding restructuring charges, was 5.7%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/14/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q2-2023/"},{"c":"ERIC 2023 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2023-07-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"So, when we are in the market, as we are today, that's challenging, we are intensifying our efforts on the cost-out initiatives, and we are well on track to reduce our annual run rate by at least 11 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/07/14/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q2-2023/"},{"c":"ERIC 2023 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2023-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"Secondly, gross margin, we came in at 39.2%, excluding restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/17/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q3-2023/"},{"c":"ERIC 2023 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2023-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Carl Mellander","x":"Third point regarding EBITA margin, we exceeded the previously mentioned expectations due to early positive effects of the cost-out ambitions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/10/17/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q3-2023/"},{"c":"ERIC 2023 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2024-01-23","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"It may be new type of use cases that come up that demands more bandwidth, whether that is XR applications, whether it's new type of streaming services, new type of social media, I don't know.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/23/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2023/"},{"c":"ERIC 2023 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2024-01-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"And this has actually enabled us to deliver against our cost savings target of 12 billion kroner gross out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/23/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2023/"},{"c":"ERIC 2023 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2024-01-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"So, as we focus on driving fundamental improvements to our cost structure, and we expect to take additional actions, including reducing headcount as we pare back some investment areas and focus our portfolio where we really can win.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/01/23/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2023/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q1","e":"eric","d":"2024-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"So despite the market headwind and difficult market conditions, we maintained our market-leading position and delivered a good improvement in gross margin to 42.7%, excluding restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/16/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q1-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q1","e":"eric","d":"2024-04-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Borje Ekholm","x":"We continue to be disciplined in our execution, including proactively taking cost-saving measures to ensure that we're well-positioned to maximize shareholder value when the market ultimately improves.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/04/16/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q1-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2024-07-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Didier Scemama","x":"Your main competitor in Europe just acquired an optical vendor to have sort of a bigger footprint in data center and sort of AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/12/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q2-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2024-07-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Erik Brje Ekholm","x":"So, in Q2, we continue to work with our customers and focus on leveraging our leading technology as well as optimizing our business through our strategic initiatives, which, of course, includes our cost reduction actions that we have taken.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/12/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q2-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2024-07-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lars Sandstrom","x":"We are continuing to take action on costs, including sizing our organization to serve the new level of customer demand, and we recently announced or recently concluded the union negotiation in Sweden on planned headcount reductions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/12/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q2-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2024-10-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Erik Brje Ekholm","x":"And the reason for that divestiture as it will allow us to streamline the business focus on the core opportunities at hand and really maximize the strategic positioning of our portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/15/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q3-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q3","e":"eric","d":"2024-10-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lars Sandstrom","x":"Margins improved with favorable market mix, focus on commercial discipline, cost-out activities, and higher IPR licensing revenues and also the improved usage and the whole supply chain here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/10/15/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q3-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2025-01-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Erik Brje Ekholm","x":"It's anything from AR/VR glasses, but I would single out one trend that's actually going to be very big for the traffic and start to impact network investments, and it's the whole AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/24/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2025-01-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Francois Bouvignies","x":"We have seen, of course, Trump getting into elections and talking about the tariff potential.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/24/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2025-01-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Francois Bouvignies","x":"And I was wondering, how should we factor the potential of tariff over time in your business?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/24/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2025-01-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lars Sandstrom","x":"The cost-out activities continued to deliver savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/24/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2024 Q4","e":"eric","d":"2025-01-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lars Sandstrom","x":"Margin improved with a favorable market mix, cost reduction initiatives, including supply chain efficiency, as well as higher IPR licensing revenues and the focus on more profitable market segments in enterprise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/01/24/telefonaktiebolaget-lm-ericsson-publ-eric-q4-2024/"},{"c":"ERIC 2026 Q2","e":"eric","d":"2026-07-14","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Dan